WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:03.830
- These are not necessarily
places I'm going to recommend,

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.851
but if you find yourself there,

00:00:05.851 --> 00:00:06.608
you gotta eat.

00:00:06.608 --> 00:00:10.374
(mariachi music)

00:00:10.374 --> 00:00:12.301
Today we've taken a look at five

00:00:12.301 --> 00:00:14.135
Mexican fast food restaurants,

00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:16.924
and we're trying to find the
healthiest options for you

00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:18.934
if these are the places
that you find yourself at.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.792
First up we're looking at Taco Bell.

00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:23.393
One of the things I liked
about Taco Bell is that they're

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:25.160
up front with their ingredients,

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.971
and I saw they had like a healthy menu.

00:00:26.971 --> 00:00:28.360
When they have those,

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.102
go for them.

00:00:29.102 --> 00:00:31.579
So I did the Cantina Power Bowl,

00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:32.899
I don't care for cheese,

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.106
so I take off the cheese,
(electronic buzz)

00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:36.382
but I'm gonna add in their salsa,

00:00:36.382 --> 00:00:37.589
but not their regular salsa,
(electronic buzz)

00:00:37.589 --> 00:00:39.656
the salsa that has the pico de gallo,

00:00:39.656 --> 00:00:41.536
because it has less sodium in it.

00:00:41.536 --> 00:00:43.348
I did not do the guacamole.

00:00:43.348 --> 00:00:45.600
It wasn't worth it, I'd rather
just eat an avocado later.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.527
So next up we had Del Taco.

00:00:47.527 --> 00:00:49.547
I,

00:00:49.547 --> 00:00:52.089
uh, don't really have
anything I would get at

00:00:52.089 --> 00:00:53.157
Del Taco.
(electronic buzz)

00:00:53.157 --> 00:00:56.375
So if you're gonna go to Del
Taco this is what I would say:

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:58.674
get, get what you want.

00:00:58.674 --> 00:01:00.462
It's not gonna be that good for you.

00:01:00.462 --> 00:01:02.041
(sigh) Chipotle.

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:04.084
I always think you're so healthy.

00:01:04.084 --> 00:01:06.313
I was shocked

00:01:06.313 --> 00:01:07.521
at the amount of fat.

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:09.099
We're talking

00:01:09.099 --> 00:01:11.131
two days worth of fat.

00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:13.598
Don't even go into the tacos,

00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:15.759
or the burritos, just don't even.

00:01:15.759 --> 00:01:17.622
I would get the burrito bowl.

00:01:17.622 --> 00:01:19.851
Black beans or rice.

00:01:19.851 --> 00:01:22.264
I would get the chicken, and I would get

00:01:22.264 --> 00:01:23.495
pico de gallo with it,

00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:25.654
and I would get the fajita veggies.

00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:26.653
No cheese.
(electronic buzz)

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:28.348
No guacamole.
(electronic buzz)

00:01:28.348 --> 00:01:29.276
Sorry.

00:01:29.966 --> 00:01:31.645
I have to say, I was surprised.

00:01:31.645 --> 00:01:33.997
It actually had some really good options.

00:01:33.997 --> 00:01:35.738
The one that I would get

00:01:35.738 --> 00:01:37.539
is the classical salad.

00:01:37.539 --> 00:01:39.280
You can get it with or without chicken,

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.718
it doesn't change it too
much in terms of fat.

00:01:41.718 --> 00:01:42.691
I wouldn't get it with the cheese--

00:01:42.691 --> 00:01:43.091
(electronic buzz)

00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:44.670
but know if you do get it with the cheese

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.388
it brings up the fat, the saturated fat

00:01:46.388 --> 00:01:47.479
in particular.

00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:49.662
And then I would actually
get the dressing on the side,

00:01:49.662 --> 00:01:51.148
an avocado salsa.

00:01:51.943 --> 00:01:54.038
I've eaten at Baja Fresh.

00:01:54.038 --> 00:01:56.198
I like the sound of the name,

00:01:56.198 --> 00:01:57.242
it's fresh,

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:59.402
I think they're gonna have
fresh ingredients there.

00:01:59.402 --> 00:02:03.011
I was surprised at how
many calories are in

00:02:03.011 --> 00:02:04.288
some of the salads.

00:02:04.288 --> 00:02:05.890
So the one that I picked was

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.793
the Baja Barbecue Chicken Salad.

00:02:08.793 --> 00:02:10.093
I put the dressing on it.

00:02:10.093 --> 00:02:12.043
And even with the dressing it's not

00:02:12.043 --> 00:02:13.343
too bad in terms of calories.

00:02:13.343 --> 00:02:15.340
If they offer fresh avocado

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.594
I would put that on there.

00:02:16.594 --> 00:02:19.304
But I wouldn't do the guacamole.

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:21.162
The biggest surprise for me with Baja

00:02:21.162 --> 00:02:23.484
was that all their tostada salads

00:02:23.484 --> 00:02:25.063
are over 1000 calories.

00:02:25.063 --> 00:02:26.966
If I'm gonna eat 1000
calories for a salad,

00:02:26.966 --> 00:02:29.474
I'm going all out for a burrito

00:02:29.474 --> 00:02:30.867
that has the works

00:02:30.867 --> 00:02:33.027
with all kinds of sour
cream and guacamole,

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:34.422
and I'm just gonna forget.

00:02:35.379 --> 00:02:37.098
So here are my top three ways

00:02:37.098 --> 00:02:38.746
that you can eat healthier.

00:02:38.746 --> 00:02:39.907
First, number one,

00:02:39.907 --> 00:02:41.300
don't order off the menu.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.947
So have an idea of what
you want before you go in,

00:02:43.947 --> 00:02:46.836
and then try to add some
healthy things to it.

00:02:46.836 --> 00:02:49.930
So number two is, have your
sauces and your dressings

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:50.766
on the side.

00:02:50.766 --> 00:02:53.645
Get it on the side, put a little
bit on or dip your fork in,

00:02:53.645 --> 00:02:54.852
or dip your food in,

00:02:54.852 --> 00:02:57.221
and just eat a little bit of it.

00:02:57.221 --> 00:02:58.618
That will save calories.

00:02:58.618 --> 00:03:00.133
And number three is,

00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:02.200
whenever you can add vegetables,

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.012
go for it.

00:03:03.012 --> 00:03:04.521
That's going to bulk things up,

00:03:04.521 --> 00:03:07.052
it's gonna give you more fiber,
more vitamins and minerals,

00:03:07.052 --> 00:03:09.769
and you won't have to
eat as many of the tacos

00:03:09.769 --> 00:03:11.597
or the burritos or the other options,

00:03:11.597 --> 00:03:13.786
because you'll be more full on

00:03:13.786 --> 00:03:15.110
roughage.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.078
(piano melody)

